NNAAMMEE
     ttwwss — 3ware 9750 SATA+SAS 6Gb/s RAID controller card driver

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     To compile this driver into the kernel, place the following lines in your
     kernel configuration file:

           ddeevviiccee ssccbbuuss
           ddeevviiccee ttwwss

     Alternatively, to load the driver as a module at boot time, place the
     following line in loader.conf(5):

           tws_load="YES"

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ttwwss driver provides support for LSI's 3ware 9750 SATA+SAS 6Gb/s RAID
     controller cards.

     These controllers feature the LSISAS2108 6Gb/s SAS RAID-on-Chip (ROC) and
     are available in 4- and 8-port configurations, supports RAID levels 0, 1,
     5, 6, 10, 50 and single disk, with 96 SATA and/or SAS hard drives and
     SSDs.

     For further hardware information, see _h_t_t_p_:_/_/_w_w_w_._l_s_i_._c_o_m_/_.

HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     The ttwwss driver supports the following SATA/SAS RAID controller:

     ••   LSI's 3ware SAS 9750 series

LLOOAADDEERR TTUUNNAABBLLEESS
