     stored in loader.conf(5).

     _h_w_._t_w_s_._c_a_m___d_e_p_t_h       The maximum queued CAM SIM requests for one con‐
                            troller.  The default value is 256.

     _h_w_._t_w_s_._e_n_a_b_l_e___m_s_i      This tunable enables MSI support on the controller
