     _h_w_._t_w_s_._q_u_e_u_e___d_e_p_t_h     The maximum queued requests for one controller.

     _h_w_._t_w_s_._u_s_e___3_2_b_i_t___s_g_l_s  Limit the driver to use only 32-bit SG elements
